		["Marion Call is keeping Dark Cleric Beryl company in the reading room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast edge of Brill.  I'm just dying to see who wins that staring contest."] = "401d08a40d2bbc1996b8b3974f466abc",
		["That's Rupert Boch you're looking for.  He and his entourage have a room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of Brill."] = "51f8b17d8b9488e0ccd4bd533aa062d3",
		["Yeah, that would be Austil de Mon.  He's always hanging out in the tavern at the southeast end of town.  It's called the Gallows' End Tavern, you can't miss it."] = "8a3263760d4d0df6c2f50cf4266a0ae5",
		["You'll find Carolai Anise trying to blow up her house at the northwest end of town.  Why don't you go see if you can help her?"] = "a7fa537c7b0432b939cd07a8db5249bb",
		["Blacksmith?  Nope, our last one turned back into one of those mindless Scourge.  There's one in the Undercity though to the south of town though.  Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron, clever name, huh?  Just take the elevators down at the back of the ruins and then you can talk to one of the Undercity Guardians.  They should be able to point you in the right direction."] = "cf043be13d65871775db5915c930b85b",
		["Why cook when everything tastes like ashes in your mouth?  If you have one still that is.  Very well, head to the Undercity south of Brill and ask an Undercity Guardian there for further directions to their Cooking Trainer.  To get there you can take the elevators down from the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron."] = "8313213d75e6f7833f8797c2bdbcf6b2",
		["Word is that Vance Undergloom has taken a permanent room upstairs at the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town.  I think he's just off the reading room."] = "c60120c8d889359d6ad321e0d26aeeb2",
		["Rifles, dynamite, bombs, exploding sheep... what's not to love?  To learn how to make these and many other exciting tools of the trade head to the Undercity, under the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  Take the elevators down at the back of the ruins.  Once you arrive speak to one of the Undercity Guardians about where the trainer is exactly."] = "e409c34e00dbc45b47e8c9dbf314a4dc",
		["Butcher you say?  Oh, First Aid Trainer!  Same thing.  When you see Nurse Neela standing just inside the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of town you'll know why."] = "2efa1bcf49300d8f807523fd6673df71",
		["Yeah, you'll always find Clyde Kellen fishing on the bank of Brightwater Lake just east of Brill.  Just watch out for psychos wearing masks while you're out there.  We had to shut down the kids' summer camp last year."] = "bec655628b2ba6a6a8f247919f4f203d",
		["Actually I prefer traditional medicines... leeches, maggots, bonesaws... that sort of thing.  Well to each their own.  You can find the our local Herbalism Trainer, Faruza, standing out front near the stables in Brill."] = "0939bad12351da20cc3b8d4e77a7fee8",
		["Nothing quite like the feel of something dead rubbing up against you.  You can find Shelene Rhobart by heading southeast on the road out of town, and then going east at the intersection.  She's at a small camp there not too far along the road."] = "103bf72df1b5fce49d05a3edff6ff22e",
		["I guess your first exercise is going to be to mine your way down to the Undercity.  Heh, get it?  Mine... nevermind.  To get to the Undercity go to the rear of the Ruins of Lordaeron south of Brill, and take the elevator down.  Ask one of the Undercity Guardians there for further assistance."] = "15ea84887025f02a521a2456a5bf77a9",
		["You aiming to be a taxidermist?  I don't like people who think they can stuff and mount me because they think I'm dead.  No?  Good!  Look for Rand Rhobart at a camp to the southeast of town.  To get to him take the road southeast out of Brill and hang a left at the intersection."] = "3f5cc117ebd220215e10fa35e0a1dce8",
		["Black, grey and dark purple are the prescribed colors.  See to it that you don't stray onto the wrong side of fashion street friend.  Bowen Brisboise can help to see that you don't.  You'll find him inside Cold Hearth Manor on the other side of the bridge to the southwest of town."] = "9189817d90eaaf387d6f475085c6270b",
		["What are you looking for?"] = "2cce376a7f0e367a39a45e26216ab5f2",
		["We don't have a bank here in Brill, you'll have to go to the Undercity for that.  At the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south are elevators that will take you down into the Undercity.  Once there, ask one of the Undercity Guardians for more precise directions."] = "beef739f98b7422424f6cc892f07f0aa",
		["There's a Bat Handler inside the Undercity.  Head south down the road out of Brill, then west at the T-intersection.  The Ruins of Lordaeron will be on your left.  Go into them and then down into the Undercity.  You can ask an Undercity Guardian there for further assistance."] = "8e6d351e4b5ed5b89d136ecabc40dd4d",
		["You'll find Innkeeper Renee inside the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of the street running through town."] = "2557195bf3e59ed32c3d8e138273a3aa",
		["Morganus the stable master can be found out in front of the stables strangely enough."] = "7e077ea3795c4616340d79cc24a4a758",
		["Which trainer do you seek?"] = "59f12cd78c4d26b8aee81e68100d276a",
		["Which profession?"] = "8d09546b60b6d39bda2ac4ec0471ced5",
		["You'll find the Mage Trainer, Cain Firesong, upstairs on the landing at the Gallows' End Tavern, which is on the southeast end of Brill.  I guess he checked in too late to get a room."] = "1e5f1737a1701a50722b2b5518364863",
		["Paladin? Have you been partaking of the Apothecary's concoctions or some such thing? I have heard a rumor that some elven contingent is visiting the Dark Lady within the Undercity. Perhaps one of them might know."] = "a8f3158597b88c14cd0189f3b0834ffb",
		["At the southeast edge of town is the Gallows' End Tavern.  Go there and head upstairs, and you'll find Dark Cleric Beryl inside the reading room."] = "0c7b458308be384d96d85e82cd05977f",
		["The Rogue Trainer's name is Marion Call.  You can find her upstairs in the reading room at the Gallows' End Tavern at the town's southeast edge."] = "3ee5a4b825abc707bb4630a9bbad2bf3",
		["Rupert Boch is his name.  I hear that he's upstairs in one of the rooms at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast end of town."] = "01124c3b711e07151142abc5f95268f2",
		["Look inside the Gallows' End Tavern's main dining room for Austil de Mon.  The tavern is on the southeast edge of Brill."] = "616358afa775aba892d936fda890ea34",
		["Our Alchemist's name is Carolai Anise.  You'll find her in a house at the northwest end of Brill."] = "3866411706250b90fd5b8f8e06a403fb",
		["Sorry friend, we don't have one of those here in Brill.  You'll have to head to the Undercity for that.  The Undercity is underneath the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of Brill.  From the back of the ruins take the elevator down and then speak to one of the Undercity Guardians to find your way further."] = "1139c3ddc8af6aee008200acb0687a4d",
		["Fancy yourself a chef?  Head to the Undercity south of town for your training.  You can catch the elevators heading down at the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Talk to one of those lumbering Undercity Guardians for further assistance once you arrive."] = "6f3dc341f1c868637188480b03d81828",
		["You can find Vance Undergloom upstairs in a room at the Gallows' End Tavern on the southeast side of Brill."] = "f3fcdf2085aaeddd3fb4d9eb72210d18",
		["While there's no Engineering Trainer in Brill, there is one down in the Undercity.  To get there head to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron to the south of town and take the elevator down.  Once you get there ask an Undercity Guardian for more specific directions."] = "b9c7c0e581d2907d5cd3e5f622b7ca2d",
		["Nurse Neela greets all of her future customers as they enter the Gallows' End Tavern at the southeast end of town."] = "ecc77cd6a30b13bcf17021722aa5919f",
		["Clyde Kellen, the local bass master, has his favorite fishing spot just east of Brill at Brightwater Lake."] = "5ba96289663e59e56f3ab679b5ca74e1",
		["Look for Faruza.  Last I saw she was standing out front between the stables and the house on the northwest end of town."] = "977af039ec3c7a44b7db0d8dff2bd8d9",
		["You'll want to look in the Undercity.  In the old Ruins of Lordaeron, south of here, you'll find an elevator down. Once you're there, ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions."] = "d64519035831aa5624223023f3b1f255",
		["That would be Shelene Rhobart.  Take the road southeast out of Brill then head east at the intersection.  She's at a camp along the side of the road."] = "a5c7a15cdd9cd24c0896986897aa6257",
		["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in the Undercity.  All you have to do to get there is head south out of town and go to the back of the Ruins of Lordaeron.  Then take the elevator down into the Undercity itself and ask an Undercity Guardian for further directions."] = "b880e21a58d9603b16f9e2ef471c8aab",
		["Rand Rhobart is fairly good at skinning felbats and the like.  You can find him at a camp along the road to the southeast of Brill.  Take the road southeast out of town and then head east at the intersection."] = "a25fe9ad1bdfb172b3a2dd3d0ef51db1",
		["It is Bowen Brisboise that you seek then.  You'll find him inside his house southwest of Brill just on the other side of the bridge at Cold Hearth Manor."] = "7fd1483462d52d9cdaa86c1b708ae95f"
	},
	["High Executor Darthalia"] = {
		["You will speak when spoken to."] = "7a3a52922026b0b02d75f3712ef3b432",
		["In order to serve the Dark Lady and Varimathras we need to advance the front on the Human Infestation."] = "981d973c642e05e6577ae07a20a77254"
	},
	["Karos Razok"] = {
		["Greetings.  Our bats are well trained and fed.  You'll not find faster."] = "fa762cd2402b543f4083d66aa2a57e13"
	},
	["Tog'thar"] = {
		["Get away from here, $c, or they'll put you in chains as well."] = "77c86eaf2987bb99b8be605cc0566070",
		["Marlgen... One of the jailors. He has the key to my bonds."] = "f4af4d3766364463420bec302a318132"
	},
	["Drull"] = {
		["Do you mock me while I am unable to defend myself, bound to this ball of iron?"] = "ed5b5a2b8d5bee46993333b4c3f3eafe",
		["One of the humans has the key to this infernal contraption. Eston I think they said his name was."] = "89766cf6963eb64a903985c79701ac18"
	},
	["Borgus Stoutarm"] = {
		["Where would you like to fly to?"] = "646a52da6f00e2b6b680741da2aab13f"
	},
	["Aethalas"] = {
		["Greetings $c.  Do you wish to aid the Silverwing Sentinels in their fight at Warsong Gulch?"] = "5f903d5d4508abe7b82460c9b5fcf80e",
		["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."] = "db6d2a2e49b804a2cf643369c2d678f3"
	},
	["Thamner Pol"] = {
		["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."] = "ac5120ee0f594edb256081dbc34f1a6f",
		["I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques."] = "73b3f07d486fb7ce23b8df9c95511471",
		["I can train you in First Aid techniques."] = "61338bf2449f9fe80a4879d402d94c72"
	},
	["Shaina Fuller"] = {
		["Oh, a fellow Physician. I would be glad to teach you anything that would aid your journeys."] = "5871df482a5322411e3250bb05234252",
		["Yes my $g son : daughter;? What can I assist you with?"] = "a9c31ad2585736a1fb03d2ae8ab3eacd",
		["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."] = "1d81b661f251fb69f984eaa16be96159"
	},
	["Michelle Belle"] = {
		["The esteemed Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen can train you further.  He can be found in Theramore treating the wounded at the barracks."] = "1d81b661f251fb69f984eaa16be96159",
		["I've heard it said that Deneb Walker, holed up in Stromgarde, has a book that is sure to help improve your First Aid techniques."] = "6bb0666f31370413b0bedf9c9606f6aa",
		["I can train you in First Aid techniques."] = "6e0e069ae3df14ed20af0f9912ceff68"
	},
	["Innkeeper Anderson"] = {
		["Welcome to my Inn, weary traveler. What can I do for you?"] = "e3e01e02de026cbe5e2560a468bbdebb",
		["When you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become 'well rested' much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.$B$BYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn."] = "1ace391ed091f2d6bd3843235747422c"
	},
	["Merideth Carlson"] = {
		["Years of quality breeding techniques and plenty of care allow me the privilege of showing you these horses!  Please, take your time as you consider them for your mount.  A horse is a companion for the ages, friend.  Don't sell yourself short - get your steed here today!"] = "0016d0ff7c43ada7e4f367d5b24e9b81",
		["Sorry, but I am not disposed to sell horses to any individual who is not considered to be at least exalted to the Kingdom of Stormwind.  These steeds are the finest you'll find anywhere, and we certainly wouldn't want them in the hands of our enemies.$B$BNot saying you're an enemy, of course... just earn the trust of Stormwind and then we can do business."] = "33c0e9087e12555f8dc52cc2a68cccb1"
	},
	["Donald Rabonne"] = {
		["Your skill exceeds mine, though  I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'.  That is sure to help you increase your skill."] = "13d2af5f294a07ae2cff1bf240fa32c1",
		["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."] = "43ebea4a5129c29af35af2064eb93951",
		["I can teach you fishing skills."] = "b285645e1bdb1be37d7bfdc440534eec"
	},
	["Innkeeper Shay"] = {
		["Rest your weary bones for a spell."] = "cf5c0c6563faca35ab89050ffaff07a3",
		["When you stay at an inn, you rest very comfortably.  Because of this, you will become 'well rested' much more quickly than you would in the wilderness.  When you are well rested, you learn more from experience.$B$BYou may also speak with any innkeeper to get a hearthstone, and can later use the hearthstone in order to quickly return to that inn."] = "52d7c1d908b6e41fe75c4365ede9ab2b"
	},
	["Serge Hinott"] = {
		["Another interruption. How am I supposed to get any work done like this? Don't answer that; do I look as if I care what you have to say? If we are to ever get this place cleaned up and expand our empire I will need absolute silence!"] = "40e48bbf15011ec9bbf38ab6d714648e"
	},
	["Christoph Jeffcoat"] = {
		["Can I show you what I have for sale? "] = "883f1ea8f0071f3bf893a674d97254c5"
	},
	["Derak Nightfall"] = {
		["Derak Nightfall, at your service!"] = "050ad2b08abc89f1ba906f744ed50792"
	},
	["Daryl Stack"] = {
		["The place is a bit drafty... but what do I care? I'm dead."] = "63cdedde8533ba7dc21f076eea1338a3"
	},
	["Felicia Maline"] = {
		["Where would you like to fly to?"] = "f6ea55ad6f6344693225294350de4559"
	},
	["Darla Harris"] = {
		["Where would you like to fly to?"] = "f6ea55ad6f6344693225294350de4559"
	},
	["Major Samuelson"] = {
		["<The Major nods curtly.>"] = "17010776002d3f11106e969667abd8e0"
	},
	["Olivia Burnside"] = {
		["Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"] = "1cf62073cd912caabcc1fd6d29dd3aa6",
		["No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!"] = "8aebd1628c8cd2becdb32845edc4fbe8"
	},
	["Newton Burnside"] = {
		["Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"] = "884e826914eac49c2ac85af2e236b022",
		["No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!"] = "dcd77e7267840142a221c406ad8d42b0"
	},
	["John Burnside"] = {
		["Welcome to the Bank of Stormwind. We offer financial accounts and safety deposit boxes for valuable items. Do you already have an account with us $g sir : ma'am;?"] = "884e826914eac49c2ac85af2e236b022",
		["No one's ever stolen anything out of here. Not in the whole history of... the whole history!"] = "dcd77e7267840142a221c406ad8d42b0"
	},
	["Commander Aggro'gosh"] = {
		["Welcome to Grom'gol, $c.  Before we get off on the wrong foot, I'll have you know that I won't have slackers in my Base Camp.  I expect a healthy $r like you to pull your own weight around here."] = "2457af47f4573d4b9c53f50b98a2bfa8"
	},
	["Far Seer Mok'thardin"] = {
		["Even in this remote corner of the world, know that Hellscream's eyes are upon you."] = "4ac2b57127c9e88c411f40373faea808"
	},
	["Larimaine Purdue"] = {
		["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."] = "6169b63082c1481ee1b292a6bd277450",
		["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready."] = "c0b64230899c1f169032e2124bab7479"
	},
	["Fleet Master Seahorn"] = {
		["Welcome to Booty Bay, $r."] = "6e2c2b7bf403ccc15e5f9045ee8b8468",
		["Ah, smell the fine salt air!  'Tis always nice to return to our home port of Booty Bay."] = "496a7021783fdc1cea8c98ac11f63e3c"
	},
	["Milstaff Stormeye"] = {
		["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."] = "a53aefa25ac89a757bcbfc41b3fc84f0",
		["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready."] = "f69b2a52cbd83a17600754efeeae8fbe"
	},
	["Whiskey Slim"] = {
		["Here's to you!  Here's to me!  May we never disagree.$b$bBut if we do... BLAST YOU!  Here's to me."] = "79434ad09b756e3a37e7e94789fdd67d"
	},
	["Lexington Mortaim"] = {
		["I do not believe you possess the mental acuity to grasp the nature of portal magic."] = "94b6577e5651410a517d8b6494716ade",
		["As a mage, you are one of a select group that can conjure a portal to transport you back to this very place.  I can teach you if you are ready."] = "3de4dfc277400108c32e9317af807f3a"
	},
	["Baron Revilgaz"] = {
		["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  I hope your stay in my town is enjoyable and uneventful - emphasis on the latter.  We've got plenty of drink if you're thirsty, and plenty of bouncers if you're antsy.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"] = "a122cd69a20b3e81ab38fa94be544fd8",
		["Welcome to Booty Bay, partner.  Don't mind DeMeza and her crew... we let the hellion run riot one day a year, Pirates' Day, and then she leaves us in peace to go plunder the South Seas again.$B$BNow then... what can this humble servant of the Steamwheedle Cartel do for you?  Better still - what can you do for me, eh?"] = "26d19217c8c4c238e964d2d5e390827a"
	},
	["Nimboya"] = {
		["The trolls of Stranglethorn don't take too kindly to us Darkspear.  I'm not afraid of no Bloodscalp or Skullsplitter, but still... Grom'gol's high walls make me feel safe."] = "8840e1a47fcc91cdebb2854e3fe73dc4",
		["Eh?  You have business with Nimboya?"] = "0a7eb8b87be96bb74cc6324eeed852d5"
	},
	["Grarnik Goodstitch"] = {
		["They say a stitch in time saves... what, eleven? Ah, I can't remember. Stupid saying anyway."] = "4695d885c5423f51c542ad1df66c86b0"
	},
	["Narkk"] = {
		["Care to purchase some piratey items?"] = "cb25d8652581fa46d9c1921cd362103b"
	},
	["Xizk Goodstitch"] = {
		["Welcome to my shop, $c. What is it the Goodstitch brothers can do for you?"] = "99c06dc6ce2b538a25922d66ed241e64"
	},
	["Captain Nials"] = {
		["We must take what is ours. Our survival depends on it."] = "208eac1bba478d19a31a63560ee43869",
		["We at Refuge Pointe hold one of the few remaining patches of Stromgarde territory in the Arathi Highlands.  And we're losing ground...$B$BIf you have words for me, then I hope they are good tidings."] = "35885c6440abfadbf78a865c29a8a140"
	},
	["Hanashi"] = {
		["Heya mon.  You come right place learn how ta wield a new weapon."] = "cc3e350a79b20307088a569e80902909",
		["What you want to learn, mon?"] = "dabd5436eb15ed35034b271ee3a2fde7",
		["Archibald da master of da crossbow. He da weapon master of da Undercity, located in da War Quarter."] = "15357ffda978111a09c38aef0f33f96f",
		["Sayoc, da ugly orc here, teach you daggers. You want teaching in other places, you talk to Ileda in da Farstrider Square of Silvermoon or Archibald in the War Quarter of Undercity, hokay?"] = "bae866eade8cdeffb1c272bad4daf29d",
		["You want to punch things, yah? Talk to Sayoc right here. He teach you."] = "2146ca283b53d8a95bda6d3a66685c9e",
		["Our gunnery instructor, he Ansekhwa, da tauren weapon master on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."] = "e757397a798d37b09864e5b701499afe",
		["Maces, they taught by Ansekhwa, found on da lower central rise of Thunder Bluff."] = "4161fa63f69fb37ce4b075cd4fb19ceb",
		["Da Forsaken weapon master Archibald know his way 'round da polearm. He train others in da War Quarter of da Undercity. Ileda, da blood elf weapon master in Farstrider Square in Silvermoon, show you da right techniques too, mon."] = "3464015d839e0bc466fffad2d3e5ce49",
		["Ileda of da blood elves, in Farstrider Square of Silvermoon, train her students in both one and two-handed swords. Archibald, da Undercity's weapon master, also train you, mon. He in da War Quarter."] = "adb28555d90beac1714be25bd7ee4f80"
	},
	["Archmage Malin"] = {
		["Pleased to meet you, $c."] = "febba573b46c69877a545a2f40fd3b1a"
	},
	["Drum Fel"] = {
		["We're glad to have your help."] = "4bd232c056addf5e5c192a6f3048185f"
	},
	["Theldurin the Lost"] = {
		["You lookin' for me?"] = "1b48b56038b2a57d47d69fb63d6df29e",
		["Back away!  Stay back!  I have a pack full of blastpowder and I'm not afraid to use it!  I'll blow us all away!$B$BOh, never mind.  I thought you were someone else...."] = "91c4313b56ed5abecc4be72cfbade940"
	},
	["Apprentice Kryten"] = {
		["Don't mind Skuerto, $n. He doesn't mean to be rude, he's just terribly busy. While we wait for him to finish scouting, why don't we work on something more productive?"] = "2a934c9aeb08dec90a0d0e7b99a9e8d0"
	},
	["Skuerto"] = {
		["I'm sick of sittin' in this hole. I hope whatever sorry pencil-pusher is holdin' up Danath's return gets a punch in the jimmies."] = "e475952a35167f78f51e1a323955052c"
	},
	["Pand Stonebinder"] = {
		["Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall."] = "9cf8ec329c7dba4ed49715a51df03f95",
		["I can train you in First Aid techniques."] = "0a7cfd25fd53892de58e9eaf21bc1e16"
	},
	["Kurden Bloodclaw"] = {
		["I am sorry $c, but you are not seasoned enough yet to enter Warsong Gulch."] = "7fe3331e4b1c06adee7ab9eb667d175d",
		["Are you here to fight for us at Warsong Gulch?  Lok'tar Ogar $c!"] = "61dae5f4ed0e4cb3f60d344587e21b7c"
	},
	["Myizz Luckycatch"] = {
		["Your skill exceeds mine, though  I've heard that Old Man Heming in Booty Bay has copies of 'The Bass and You'.  That is sure to help you increase your skill."] = "3bcdd8ed1fc1986116ad0c43c7de1475",
		["You will need to find Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh to get any better than you are currently."] = "0bf837bea513c0c82387777d0998bdfb",
		["I can teach you fishing skills."] = "2d127f614bfaf60be0fcf5c914c9f116"
	},
	["Cedrik Prose"] = {
		["Where would you like to fly to?"] = "65b6f5b0f34f015f60d92c6c8d6e3d71"
	},
	["Brikk Keencraft"] = {
		["Yeah? Of course I'm a smith. What, you think Dwarves are the only ones worth their weight in anvils? Fine, be that way. Go get a dwarf to help you!"] = "29b36a70548ade1ec5054bd5082e4b54"
	},
	["Jaxin Chong"] = {
		["Glyx and I have an understanding: he keeps me supplied, and I keep him rich. Seriously! What that pirate charges me for a measly pouch of crumpled kingsblood... it's enough to make a grown goblin cry."] = "e56ab09499777010cc558c0dd0ece4c2"
	},
	["Urda"] = {
		["Where would you like to fly to?"] = "0edd3c73540d735f036ac6e027466523"
	},
	["Snang"] = {
		["We use many animal pelts and skins in our creations. "] = "414eb2110800e49fbeef5b9e23f4a1e9"
	},
	["Thund"] = {
		["Who says orcs aren't smart? It takes a lot of brains to be an engineer!"] = "ffe9f497233899e162f84eafcbd6d0d3"
	},
	["Gringer"] = {
		["How may I be of service?"] = "28118fefcc53acdaddf2117a97b1e13a"
	},
	["Gyll"] = {
		["Fastest gryphons this side of Aerie Peak. Want to take a ride?"] = "9a496e2e710165d755663d0d9ae15ef8"
	},
	["Peria Lamenur"] = {
		["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"] = "12e2351404174f85aa98fa3a3524bcd0",
		["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."] = "b439ced1ada35971e9ff2706f428bff0",
		["Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.$b$bEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."] = "89b81aacccdf7335c1956f175105f559",
		["You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.$b$bNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"] = "3e5a85ec64239e6074157706841cc21b"
	},
	["Karrina Mekenda"] = {
		["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"] = "12e2351404174f85aa98fa3a3524bcd0",
		["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."] = "b439ced1ada35971e9ff2706f428bff0",
		["Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.$b$bEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."] = "89b81aacccdf7335c1956f175105f559",
		["You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.$b$bNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"] = "3e5a85ec64239e6074157706841cc21b"
	},
	["Historian Karnik"] = {
		["Welcome to the Explorers' League.  If you need information, and it is in book form, then I might be able to help you out."] = "45c1a3e1ae2ba047812a1cf660e25072"
	},
	["Lucien Tosselwrench"] = {
		["You've got to try some of this beer."] = "dc4aa3e2c0f0687212fa73c19d8ee0cf",
		["Hey there, $N.$B$BLotwil's not the most perceptive boss I've had. He actually gets really involved with his work. So much so that sometimes his servants don't eat, or get paid.$B$B<Lucien frowns over at Lotwil.>$B$BBut that doesn't mean you should suffer."] = "c73828e632b03b29b139443cc995766d"
	},
	["Lanie Reed"] = {
		["Thorium Brotherhood or not, if one of them Dark Iron gets near to me they'll taste my mattock up the side of their head!  Now, where can I send ya $G lad : lass;?"] = "f38b9f9eeca159b5ac1ef5dcae9ffdb8"
	},
	["Ransin Donner"] = {
		["Hail $c. Didn't I see you recently at an exclusive gathering? You look familiar, but then again this city is a busy place.$B$BIf you attended that convention, then surely you were given a secret code. Tell me your code and I will give you a special prize in return."] = "c5afae87abc614718a9d01193dc59430"
	},
	["Tal"] = {
		["When mounted on the back of a wind rider, one sees that its reputation for strength and speed is well earned."] = "162e14a98f2a88c099856abef92342b8"
	},
	["Karn Stonehoof"] = {
		["You have the look of a $g man : woman; who seeks knowledge. Perhaps you seek the teachings of the forge, and the hammer. Perhaps I can guide you down that path. But only once you have accepted the spirits, and listened to their calling."] = "b0b47cf8dcffc971f677db7811e6e84d"
	},
	["Brek Stonehoof"] = {
		["I can instruct you in mining.  Interested?"] = "84489cffa9fc2dee534ff45f2a9e2baa"
	},
	["Tepa"] = {
		["Aren't the patterns beautiful? Each one speaks with its own voice."] = "885c5bf0a97c2817b7251f03b18168e6"
	},
	["Una"] = {
		["The needle is small, but the thread is strong, and the stitches are fine. Our pact with Thrall and the others will hold. The Horde will not be driven from these lands."] = "bff6354587177ea12e5e19d6fb616689"
	},
	["Mak"] = {
		["Cairne himself lives here, they say. Once I have finished crafting a fitting gift, I will seek him out. Perhaps he will have words of wisdom for me."] = "a1adc9308232c8c0f4e71953e5b803bf"
	},
	["Bena Winterhoof"] = {
		["When I first saw the undead, I wept, for I could not imagine their horror and loneliness. The Earth Mother spoke to me then; she sang in my blood. And she told me, 'Save them.'"] = "7ce695ef7f2710c9d9137cd9cc2d2a20"
	},
	["Teg Dawnstrider"] = {
		["Enchanting has run in our family for generations. I learned at an early age, just as my son is doing now."] = "0c0d9f103197b5c72b584118ac04a7e9"
	},
	["Komin Winterhoof"] = {
		["I can instruct you in herbalism.  Interested?"] = "7d875a48bd5bdb83d604fd83ad0ca948"
	},
	["Siln Skychaser"] = {
		["The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?"] = "ecc979039b643fbe07eecf74dbf940d3",
		["May the spirits be with you."] = "a81b670b0b0a6cd4fd4aafff91e45f6c",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "0ad2a902852beef6cfe7ead6b6979fff",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "964eaa517a97198aaa64bf17cf1cf78a"
	},
	["Tigor Skychaser"] = {
		["The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?"] = "d96f407d05286ba207ff46bf75ef4510",
