		["Bandages, anti-venoms and such things, these are the inevitable necessities of life on the plains.  Vira Younghoof can teach you this knowledge.  You can find her in the long house on the west side of Bloodhoof Village."] = "3134d4a4d8b645aeefba37aba15985b7",
		["Give a bull a fish and feed him for a day.  Teach a bull to fish and feed him for life.  Uthan Stillwater can teach you how to fish.  Seek his wisdom west of Bloodhoof Village along the banks of Stonebull Lake."] = "a50a61ff9211f062ebc4c78f9fccc5f6",
		["There are those that would teach you of Herbalism in the great home of Thunder Bluff away to the north.  Follow the road out of the village to get there and at the base of the bluff ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  There are many Bluffwatchers there who can direct you further."] = "201f3cba26808c32bb7ee62dfa628e09",
		["When we use the hides of the animals we must fell for food or protection we give honor to the Earth Mother and respect to the animal.  Chaw Stronghide can teach you of such things.  You will find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."] = "e1efe823ee30b1c010852c13a53cb700",
		["I hear that they have a Mining Trainer in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Take the road out of the village and when you get there ride the elevator to the top of the rise.  Any of the Bluffwatchers should be able to help you from there."] = "e6cb4ccc587cd2a258b3ded78ae7a3f0",
		["Ah yes, Skinning.  There is no one finer in wielding a skinning knife than Yonn Deepcut.  You can find him in the great tent at the northwest corner of the village."] = "822d9c5197a44204042199ef7be11a36",
		["Tailoring you say?  Hmmm.  Ah yes, of course.  You'll need to head to Thunder Bluff, up north.  Take the path out of the village to get there.  When you arrive at the base of the bluffs ride the elevator to the top of the rise and speak with one of the Bluffwatchers."] = "aae10fc784263c4cb468d55cea4fd71e",
		["What are you looking for?"] = "b3d11178772212cc804676804bb92ca1",
		["Ah, you must go to the great heights of Thunder Bluff to visit one of those.  Follow the path north out of Bloodhoof Village.  At the base of the bluffs is an elevator that will take you to the top.  When you get there ask for further directions from one of the Bluffwatchers."] = "9e546e689233ec91191a43a7e36c67f5",
		["There is a Wind Rider Master in the great city of Thunder Bluff to the north.  Ride the elevator from the base of Thunder Bluff to the top and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for further instructions."] = "b0b81da2b32d5fdbc23302be9744240a",
		["Innkeeper Kauth can see to your needs.  He can be found on the west side of the village in one of the long houses."] = "07ac0c881242c277b1b4be65bb1bb779",
		["Ah yes, it is Seikwa that you must find.  I believe I saw her last standing out in front of the inn."] = "4e99c32785b303ece538f803ff4fcb96",
		["Which trainer do you seek?"] = "c5fec459a17d0b54dc8cfb9f0c9066ae",
		["Which profession?"] = "4a850dc32d00c265e503622c595cebf4",
		["It is Gennia Runetotem's counsel that you seek.  You will find her in the large tent on the east side of the village."] = "dce81535973ad9064578c7dc07d654a1",
		["Yaw Sharpmane awaits you on the north edge of the village.  He can teach you the ways of the Hunter."] = "4c1b626c145d8077c5aa2db55852dcfa",
		["There is a large tent on the east side of Bloodhoof Village.  You will find Narm Skychaser awaiting you there."] = "460e9ebf106048fdb04f6a2f81157b23",
		["Krang Stonehoof stands astride his training circle at the southeast corner of the village."] = "14d4e5dc44125fe42705f2ed118e5aed",
		["While we have no Alchemy Trainer here in Bloodhoof Village, there is one in Thunder Bluff to the north.  Follow the road there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions when you get to the top."] = "83cd87a9bd04fe41340d47a6a3863fb1",
		["There is a Blacksmithing Trainer in our great home Thunder Bluff to the north.  If you seek such knowledge then head there and ask one of the Bluffwatchers for directions."] = "302142138778affead2a13087925b7b1",
		["You will find Pyall Silentstride inside the great tent in the northwest corner of the village.  He can teach you what you crave."] = "a234d4b10d5440d815b7b7172e8e8687",
		["Away to Thunder Bluff to the north is where your journey takes you then friend.  Once there seek out the wisdom of one of the Bluffwatchers who can tell you directly where to find whom you seek."] = "7c186bc25b44ca7d456a044d9c8671a4",
		["Vira Younghoof keeps her practice inside the long house on the west side of the village."] = "4f5f7ae4d60dbe2bd1bf43b0ad2e8786",
		["You are looking for Uthan Stillwater.  You will find him west of the village, fishing at Stonebull Lake."] = "50f0680942e77b17d91b589f7a3a11f1",
		["If you desire to learn the ways of Herbalism then it is to Thunder Bluff that you must go.  Follow the road north out of Bloodhoof Village and take the elevator to the top of the rise.  You can ask a Bluffwatcher there for further assistance."] = "52d1b670cce86f12a40bdf74b938d00d",
		["Seek out Poshken Hardbinder in The Pools of Vision, below the Spirit Rise."] = "1ad5603204530f4b3b1c9f9477ffa62d",
		["Inside the great tent at the northwest corner of the village is where Chaw Stronghide resides.  He will teach you what you must know of Leatherworking for now."] = "f68fe1ab41731a31f4c94d358440f989",
		["Hmmm, I think you will need to go up to Thunder Bluff to learn that.  Head north on the road out of Bloodhoof Village.  It will take you to the base of Thunder Bluff.  Ride the elevator to the top and you should be able to ask any of the Bluffwatchers there for further assistance."] = "bd7be540acfdb0455e58364636e73dda",
		["Yonn Deepcut can be found inside the great tent at the northwest corner of Bloodhoof Village."] = "951cf972b72fa8a3afed83790bceb3f0",
		["Unfortunately we do not have one who teaches Tailoring here in Bloodhoof Village, but you can find a trainer in Thunder Bluff.  Follow the path north out of the village until you come to a set of elevators.  Take one up to the top of the rise and ask one of the Bluffwatchers there for directions."] = "bbf8a87da18419b0d4c795a3f40babb6"
	},
	["Lorekeeper Raintotem"] = {
		["Only the most valiant and honorable amongst the tribe can earn the honor of being laid to rest at Red Rocks."] = "9222b17eef61cb88b1f11b2a3e74c2df"
	},
	["Deek Fizzlebizz"] = {
		["Where's my spinner? I just had it here somewhere..."] = "ff094e8310f036af29e617cb2745e696"
	},
	["Rezlak"] = {
		["Try to ignore the firm, feathery behinds of the harpies... the creatures are really quite deadly!"] = "444454efb876ece002c11d6a73ff7ec0"
	},
	["Orgrimmar Grunt"] = {
		["Go to the Valley of Strength and look for the Bank of Orgrimmar to the south of the Sky Tower."] = "de018d301b4e085249577fc8a89d67e3",
		["Where did you think the Wind Rider Master would be?  Head to the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength!"] = "cc4117ef9993d932cfdf5c2d5a0aac94",
		["The Horde Embassy is in the Valley of Strength on the west side."] = "ad7770becb12827f26b1d5b82a4ff2cc",
		["Look for Innkeeper Grishka in the Valley of Strength.  Her inn is on the east side, north of the main city gates."] = "00b633d75ae1fa912014c48b4d72a8d9",
		["You can pick up your love letters outside the bank in the middle of the Valley of Strength."] = "fb937719904534d239772b47c9691613",
		["Your voice is hoarse from yelling huh?  Find the Orgrimmar Auction House in the Valley of Strength."] = "417370286b151c1e6b627c40033486ca",
		["Look for Sayoc and Hanashi at the Valley of Honor inside Arms of Legend.  Watch your tongue around them or Sayoc may decide to give a piece of you as a snack to Grinning Dog."] = "f14e7a16a04173f66ec54208b8075d5c",
		["Xon'cha will stable your extra pets.  Find him in the Valley of Honor at the stables between the arena and the Hunter's Hall.  Now begone!"] = "3b628861bb8d914e155855b588d14140",
		["You want the Hall of Legends. It's high above the Valley of Strength on the west side."] = "b831715ca758ed7b507b76130c405dbd",
		["Shoot straight to the northwest section of the Valley of Honor.  There you will find the Hunter's Hall."] = "344a85e5f4a3c4c0738d729e077cd283",
		["What, you can't port there?  Go to the Darkbriar Lodge next to the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "0480a24b3e5541cef7fdcfa7e924deab",
		["Healing is for those who cannot endure pain.  However if you must, seek out the Spirit Lodge on the lake in the Valley of Spirits, up and above the Valley of Strength to the west."] = "1fa3c586ced557c3bdaea631e8cfb7ad",
		["Your search is almost completed.  Seek your truth in the entrance room of Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "4c4de0e6ac7f3039bca0cbd2670d0cb8",
		["Don't let me catch you stealing anything!  Look for Shenthul and his Shadowswift Brotherhood in the underground Cleft of Shadow.  Find the tunnel leading down into it south of the Valley of Wisdom."] = "3419b9d9c140852751e092702d4189c0",
		["Didn't we just break free of the Burning Legion, and here you are messing with demons again?  Seek out the Darkfire Enclave in the underground cavern known as the Cleft of Shadow.  You'll find a tunnel down into it from The Drag."] = "6ca526bae354b66bd1503bce7976aa42",
		["Find the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor and speak to Grezz Ragefist.  Let them know that I'll be reporting back in after my shift here."] = "5a9488292906cf0ad31d93ffe25beb12",
		["Potions and oils, these are things that Yelmak will teach you of if you are worthy.  Look for his shop in the middle of The Drag."] = "7b0772ebc9a5b235565acbb9ca7e647f",
		["Maybe Saru Steelfury will teach you to make an axe as good as mine some day.  Find him at The Burning Anvil in the Valley of Honor down the path to the right past Red Canyon Mining."] = "5b102304df6a5972309678eaa5a18e8b",
		["You'll want to learn from Zamja.  Head to Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag by taking the stairs on the left as you enter from the Valley of Strength."] = "44a2763d4f680bc0001187fa6341a692",
		["Can you enchant my axe?  I'll want a permanent.  Maybe later then.  Find Godan's Runeworks on the west end of The Drag near the Valley of Wisdom."] = "bf25367e52832564efb1dd6caa21d1c8",
		["You'll find that goblin and his toy shop in the Valley of Honor."] = "165d8a841850891e70fc714ffd1c96c4",
		["I guess someone needs to bandage us warriors up after the fighting.  Seek out Arnok at the Survival of the Fittest hut next to the Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  Look up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength for a lake.  That's where he's at."] = "33f0cfbdedfb4540b75760e6e465a734",
		["Fishing is a sport for the old who have not died in battle!  Go find Lumak on the lake in the Valley of Honor."] = "92b7540e175ef2c3b49c54c673b9d465",
		["Ya man, you be wantin Jandi's Arboretum.  Did I just say that?  Glok'tar I must be tired!  Follow the wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom up into The Drag and you'll find Jandi's there on the upper level."] = "3671c2d0ba4effe6e38660426dbe0683",
		["Kodohide Leatherworkers is what you want.  Find it in the middle of The Drag."] = "e111a45dd1b4ebafd9df1ca761956498",
		["Makaru can be found day and night at Red Canyon Mining in the Valley of Honor, just off the lake."] = "88853fb8636d9394f72b0a90a6a91807",
		["It is good that you wish to honor your kills by putting their bodies to use.  Find Thuwd inside the Kodohide Leatherworks in the middle of The Drag."] = "d4b14b8c0f9d15bcced07f145ecb836c",
		["Clothing!?  That won't help you against good steel!  Bah, if you're sure you want to be a tailor go find Magar's Cloth Goods in The Drag."] = "baf1a758d45b8985d1030251537be382",
		["What are you looking for?"] = "8266cd096d9a7d4dd711797d8f2e5a97",
		["The Bank of Orgrimmar is in the Valley of Strength. Look for it north of the main entrance to the city."] = "212e40d6ce80b2898cb4fdfe269d8fc8",
		["Find the Wind Rider Master at the top of The Sky Tower in the Valley of Strength. Doras will make sure you find your way to the battle you seek."] = "93a2f22e1f33f3ffdce47cbbaf61d194",
		["You're looking for Urtrun Clanbringer in the Horde Embassy.  Find it on the west side of the Valley of Strength."] = "03ceedc5860622b707780ddc0511c9a2",
		["That's the second building on the right in the Valley of Strength north of the main city entrance.  Speak to Innkeeper Gryshka."] = "1de41f4e965cfc94d22343d0475a0f3d",
		["You'll find one of those outside the Bank of Orgrimmar in the middle of the Valley of Strength."] = "542c14614dfbd3390312467be541ca3d",
		["The Orgrimmar Auction House is in the Valley of Strength.  Look for it on the east side next to Boomstick Imports."] = "93d5501792fd7bf00086f5e8721832df",
		["There are two zeppelin towers outside Orgrimmar. The eastern tower serves Tirisfal Glades and Stranglethorn Vale, while the western tower serves Northrend and Thunder Bluff."] = "58e99834e0212db07943e8104c4cb7ad",
		["Looking to learn how to use a new weapon?  Find Sayoc and Hanashi inside Arms of Legend in the Valley of Honor."] = "5b463270eaf8fe0cdc8999055fe2863b",
		["Go to the Valley of Honor and seek out Xon'cha near the stables."] = "385531b7454aebebc6629c7388c7e701",
		["Look for it high up on the west side of the Valley of Strength."] = "2e062b335f04c8ebe022e4cf2ac5bb2d",
		["You will find the battlemasters inside the Hall of the Brave in the Valley of Honor."] = "352a1f142595ac9c856d131e64ea654b",
		["Which trainer do you seek?"] = "435e0978ea935317a6ec45d3f61aeeb2",
		["Which profession?"] = "259ab151e0038a1a95938da40b06e30d",
		["The ancient tomes are always found near inscription trainers."] = "2cad2be893aa78d4976805682302dc45",
		["Look for the eastern Zeppelin Landing Tower outside of the city to the southeast."] = "8f312fd5efae69e8173f860bfe4d57cc",
		["Just outside the city's main gate is a signpost.  It will point you toward the western zeppelin tower."] = "b11f7afe8c615d1d639d61802205f625",
		["Go to the Hunter's Hall in the Valley of Honor, west of the Coliseum.  Talk to Ormak Grimshot there."] = "aacc21678ac59705cafb28680f6364ab",
		["Speak to Pephredo at the Darkbriar Lodge in the Valley of Spirits, up above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "bace675290d03c6a2b503572ec4cdd93",
		["Zayus and his priests are in the Spirit Lodge, which is in the Valley of Spirits.  Look for it on the lake up above and to west of the Valley of Strength."] = "14da5ae96a8bfd487274a88b73d94fa9",
		["You seek Kardris Dreamseeker.  She and the other shaman are in the entrance room to Thrall's Fortress in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "ebbefc3420f3bc944a14be4919fd1cfc",
		["Looking for Shenthul of the Shadowswift Brotherhood, huh?  In The Drag across from Droffers and Son Salvage look for a tunnel leading down into the Cleft of Shadow."] = "8e45d17b00de6c3c1c94a6cac4c7799f",
		["You seek Grol'dar and the Darkfire Enclave?  Find them in the underground cavern called the Cleft of Shadow.  There are two tunnels leading down into that cave, one just south of the Valley of Wisdom and the other from The Drag."] = "7e431d7cffa4d9b2dbb74f3ef9080447",
		["Speak to Grezz Ragefist in the Hall of the Brave, which is in the Valley of Honor.  Put in a good word for me!"] = "cf3a3acf39bd62ec559ce746e3f32fb9",
		["Master Pyreanor can be found among Thrall's advisors in his fortress, Grommash Hold, in the Valley of Wisdom."] = "33e7c9dfbc2b34053eb747fd35c32043",
		["Look for Yelmak's Alchemy and Potions.  Find it in the middle of The Drag, west of the huge tree."] = "f33dbb86513908163e30e1f092e2cc19",
		["Talk to Saru Steelfury at The Burning Anvil.  Go to the Valley of Honor.  It's at the end of the path to the right of Red Canyon Mining."] = "a6622c6977802a3edb26edf4867ad1bb",
		["You want Zamja at Borstan's Firepit on the upper level of The Drag.  Go up the stairs on the left as you enter The Drag from the Valley of Strength."] = "f743b893dc4619ddf5a05cfc11910a62",
		["Godan's Runeworks is where you'll go.  Look for it on the west end of The Drag, right next to the Valley of Wisdom."] = "835abab3b623c29722deb24c552e5543",
		["Look for Nogg's Machine Shop in the Valley of Honor northeast of Red Canyon Mining."] = "ff5bd7ac4f5e6ae8280b728ff9382b71",
		["Arnok makes good bandages.  Find him at the Survival of the Fittest hut on the shore of the lake next to Spirit Lodge in the Valley of Spirits.  It's above and to the west of the Valley of Strength."] = "716695ed9c7f515b4ebb3edf37ea71d9",
		["That Lumak... always fishing instead of fighting.  You'll find him out on his dock on the lake in the Valley of Honor.  While you're there say hi to Shankys for me."] = "96df6f18aa4b33b9c1bbd0c31d0e6bf4",
		["Herbs... you need to speak to Jandi at her arboretum in The Drag.  There are some wooden steps behind Asoran's Market in the Valley of Wisdom.  Follow them to the upper level of The Drag and you'll find her."] = "129c4ab6d49d6f50c527167147e528ff",
		["Jo'mah is in a building on the second floor of The Drag."] = "fc4078744f3d4b8181f1389af69576b9",
		["Go to Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag. Ask for Karolek."] = "28485619b685daed404ebf180ee82cd0",
		["Find Red Canyon Mining northeast of the lake in the Valley of Honor.  Speak to Makaru there."] = "7326db8251985f9c5b051a84eeb640c6",
		["Thuwd will show you how to skin your kills.  Look for him at Kodohide Leatherworkers in The Drag."] = "767a2d17ace785c4bde801ec49c65f59",
		["Magar's Cloth Goods is in The Drag.  Find him south of the huge tree next to the Kodohide Leatherworks."] = "c10aa5ec5fa6e5e96167f629e2799127"
	},
	["Grisha"] = {
		["As long as those dwarves stay over there we'll have no trouble.  Where are you heading $n?"] = "e335b9f12333a886ef964fef76e376d8"
	},
	["Keldas"] = {
		["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"] = "3108806b44f37624987d36cafc8de658",
		["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."] = "963db5ef5555edf879e137a605643024",
		["Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.$b$bEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."] = "93448ef4e6559ab0673e0f29e117c390",
		["You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.$b$bNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"] = "2fc46cc8f7d368a2bde1ae9739bbd240"
	},
	["Karus"] = {
		["Would you rather trust your goods with a goblin?"] = "bc269ca0f3298e0f908bb9eedbbb29c7",
		["I guarantee this bank's security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?"] = "3b27a7cc7f607a01029609d1a72bc83d",
		["Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first."] = "a90d1a70d1794a0870befff1ef52b64e"
	},
	["Doras"] = {
		["You haven't lived until you've looked down on the world from the back of a wind rider."] = "f7834eaebb9cc6ecebe0cae418cf5f59"
	},
	["Urtharo"] = {
		["Tell me what you want, and make it quick."] = "92c1b07e4e165a8813160a0c5e6a6a0c",
		["So many years of battle and slavery, it feels good to have a home again. "] = "42358e20aa4821ec13efafe2dafad720"
	},
	["Soran"] = {
		["Would you rather trust your goods with a goblin?"] = "bc269ca0f3298e0f908bb9eedbbb29c7",
		["I guarantee this bank's security with my own blood, is that good enough for you?"] = "3b27a7cc7f607a01029609d1a72bc83d",
		["Besides the Grunts outside, my brothers and I fought at the battle of Hyjal. Any who seek to steal from the bank must face us first."] = "a90d1a70d1794a0870befff1ef52b64e"
	},
	["Kaja"] = {
		["You won't find a finer firearm anywhere else in Orgrimmar."] = "c857f55ed9f00f20922501c3c98881e6"
	},
	["Grol'dar"] = {
		["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate."] = "b97ef9df39356f7363aba073a5df2301",
		["Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c."] = "5a92f47cf481eb3def2615b8693c94fc",
		["I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please."] = "9d77709c8a062efc85a9e52517f68c40",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Mirket"] = {
		["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate."] = "ffecafa199948b91b54bf591e462ea72",
		["Your will is not strong enough to manipulate the forces we control $c."] = "d02c9efbf965f15cf354f957643c58a4",
		["I'm afraid your darkness quotient isn't sufficient enough for me to bother talking to you any further.  Move along please."] = "7d7ed72febdfda1d7b221fe713304a8b",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "28f6b8de934060edb89ab0339b080fcf",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "e162e9436500395268316afb0358105b"
	},
	["Zevrost"] = {
		["The arcane only corrupts those who are weak. Keep up on your training, or you may find a similar fate."] = "b97ef9df39356f7363aba073a5df2301",
		["The darkness does not embrace you, $c.  Cease your prattle and remove yourself from my sight!  Be gone!"] = "f2f482550e6523c90affa3c4eb70f181",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Gest"] = {
		["The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory."] = "1b42fe741bf727769b650ae5612b5345",
		["I don't train your kind $c."] = "60044d7f82718835ed805cb5fdc7067b",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Ormok"] = {
		["The Shattered Hand will see the Horde to their former glory."] = "1b42fe741bf727769b650ae5612b5345",
		["I don't train your kind $c."] = "60044d7f82718835ed805cb5fdc7067b",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Lumak"] = {
		["Fish so delicious. You come learn fish? Eat fish? Mmmmm..."] = "a92b422f060c1d7ccb871bbb1aeede31"
	},
	["Gann Stonespire"] = {
		["I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.$B$BWhat can I do for you, $n?"] = "8f91f2acecd0ce7ec9e9398bfec0d760"
	},
	["Kardris Dreamseeker"] = {
		["The spirits have guided you to me. How may I be of service?"] = "93ff0e2abb20dcd5c4b04b86b60d8ab3",
		["May the spirits be with you."] = "7be5b41b6547e9fda9b4b9cb85616226",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "28f6b8de934060edb89ab0339b080fcf",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "e162e9436500395268316afb0358105b"
	},
	["Godan"] = {
		["Some adventurers think enchanting doesn't work. I find that when I challenge them to battle they change their tune!"] = "3c96e38d8275bcb879a7e7eb43dca519"
	},
	["Yelmak"] = {
		["I'm busy, $n. Tell Whuut to handle whatever it is. That young pup has been stewing all day long. He spends much more time like that, and he's going to hurt something."] = "394b7578a863582891b710fc0e4197bb"
	},
	["Ormak Grimshot"] = {
		["I have much knowledge to impress upon you, $c. You must learn to hunt with honor."] = "5b5b66a181411dac0931427a9ff18c6c",
		["I can not train you."] = "27047ba17cce8edfba9757279f001d39",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Grezz Ragefist"] = {
		["Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time?"] = "16d0219142e891e02e226e8c043e1a0c",
		["I don't train your kind, $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me."] = "f206ecd8c0fae3e09ea8c0ae587cb779",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Sorek"] = {
		["Are you here for training?  Or are you just here to waste a warrior's time?"] = "16d0219142e891e02e226e8c043e1a0c",
		["I don't train your kind, $c.  Find your own trainer before you anger me."] = "f206ecd8c0fae3e09ea8c0ae587cb779",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "3a364a4573d4825a6795e3bb454069d4",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "bd0b048c220a4b4a9febc5764fb05599"
	},
	["Saru Steelfury"] = {
		["What is it you seek at my forge? Is it training? Do you perhaps seek the secrets of steel? The mysteries of the forge? Speak up Grunt!"] = "03b20e4ae05f8ecd44ff03f0c3561c3f"
	},
	["Makaru"] = {
		["I can instruct you in mining.  Interested?"] = "e40bb020e2c08717a00ea66da78bd7ef"
	},
	["Ogunaro Wolfrunner"] = {
		["Zug zug, brave $c!  I have the finest bred wolf mounts for you to peruse.  You'll not find another animal with the level of endurance and survival instincts that the wolf has anywhere!  Please, inspect them for yourself."] = "45462d0bfb55988ee297f81dc43938d9",
		["I only make my mounts available to those who are considered exalted to Orgrimmar and the Orcish race.  Go prove yourself to us, and I'll make my mighty wolves available for your inspection."] = "889004b6fde3d6412a91b1aff5e0f67c"
	},
	["Magar"] = {
		["I made a lot of the things you see in the store. What do you think? Answer carefully, your life may depend on it."] = "d6420130e1b1b2f317ac78e25124b3bc"
	},
	["Karolek"] = {
		["Am I busy? What's that supposed to mean? Do you think I just stand here all day, twiddling my thumbs? If you're here to buy something, talk to Handor."] = "5dc27cf243a0b86654eea241255fe527"
	},
	["Urtrun Clanbringer"] = {
		["Even in peace there is still war, and many clans still fight beneath the banner of the Warchief. Are you here to add your clan to those that fight for Orgrimmar?"] = "9a8bdb372e76473a8705a53b71983df8"
	},
	["Arnok"] = {
		["Only the renowned Doctor Gregory Victor can improve your skill now.  He can be found in Arathi Highlands at Hammerfall."] = "700b50a54630ac625819418a1b304af7"
	},
	["Jorn Skyseer"] = {
		["Although we call this land the Barrens, to one who knows where to look this place teems with life."] = "be12953a2eb9e2b4f53206a938cf050f"
	},
	["Regthar Deathgate"] = {
		["We have our duties, $c.  Duties to the Horde."] = "a325f9b1e91967df6e334cb3d0b0784d"
	},
	["Zamja"] = {
		["Can Zamja help you, $r?"] = "ad344693e6c8ac1ec01370090a570643"
	},
	["Shenthul"] = {
		["The Shattered Hand's influence dominates these lands. We are the veil which covers Kalimdor: The protectorates, the police, the judges, the jury, and ultimately, the executioners. We see all, we know all.$B$BYou have grown much in the time which you have spent in service of the Hand, $n. The time has come to send you into the field.$B$BAre you prepared to undertake your next mission? "] = "e5b80def6be2f085b63829ee15ec4de0",
		["I don't train your kind $c."] = "6de484f4be256ef1578f9421e15df66b",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "5016339405f25a1000a29e26a0caf19c",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "f97b19f10507105e707356b4e7697433"
	},
	["Zando'zan"] = {
		["Zando'zan of the Shattered Hand. How can Zando'zan help you? He can't! He won't! "] = "278905793296e13c5c606639f4c4456e"
	},
	["Sian'tsu"] = {
		["Da spirits be strong wit you, mon. What kin dis troll do for ya?"] = "6c82842b379af58a9a58e28cb35a4d49",
		["May da spirits protect you mon."] = "5bcfe44c67f5e0a247451c8d54a13c74",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "857ea30c7f6e11d987a132b4e84da4dc",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "726a16a61313c27f7e293a3f05df8def"
	},
	["Jandi"] = {
		["I can instruct you in herbalism.  Interested?"] = "de765c29fdcbdd9d5d0f426e17d7c286"
	},
	["Xor'juul"] = {
		["What kin I do for ya, mon?"] = "da08a8de6ae36ba7023d844f7af43f4c",
		["Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer."] = "3a75f8b0a2ec11bc929978a4d421dc5a",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "5016339405f25a1000a29e26a0caf19c",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "f97b19f10507105e707356b4e7697433"
	},
	["Sian'dur"] = {
		["Come learn the ways of the hunter. Pride, honor, and tradition."] = "a0f285cb56be6782c0dc978d5a0617af",
		["Hey mon, you be needin' to head on over to da $c trainer."] = "990d212bc9e694de1969260a75b5fbb0",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "857ea30c7f6e11d987a132b4e84da4dc",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "726a16a61313c27f7e293a3f05df8def"
	},
	["Zel'mak"] = {
		["No matter how much one learns, there is always more to know."] = "8bc0778bec0e114d33292f64dbdda0ad",
		["I can not train you, $c."] = "487097fe0768f7f9448cf92224d94ace",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "5016339405f25a1000a29e26a0caf19c",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "f97b19f10507105e707356b4e7697433"
	},
	["Denni'ka"] = {
		["What you want?"] = "2f3ab6ff28a7c44c93ff8842544819ae"
	},
	["Nogg"] = {
		["If there were just a few more hours in a day..."] = "71545b2af437b8e180d49ce9b50338cd"
	},
	["Sovik"] = {
		["Hello, $n! If you don't see it in my shop, chances are good I can get it!"] = "3c995182358b09d304bb6e1c0a9dd8d1"
	},
	["Kirge Sternhorn"] = {
		["A foul wind blows from the East, $c."] = "69bcf88ec42c5a1d592cddc712b56407"
	},
	["Thork"] = {
		["Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.$B$BPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.$B$BThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do."] = "bc68f87f28d14f99d8f8ff4c267ffea2"
	},
	["Mangletooth"] = {
		["You! $R! Come here. <snort>$B$BTime is short, and my end <snort> is near. Mangletooth shall win; you will see. <snort>$B$BMy capture can still aid <snort> my people. The Razormane tribe is more powerful than the Bristlebacks!$B$BThe Horde looks to find out who leads the raids on their people. You <snort> shall aid Mangletooth in return for the information only I know. Mangletooth can help you! <snort> But you must help Mangletooth."] = "9e8e282112471db9001dda24206cdc0d",
		["My hatred is strong <snort>, but the time is right to tell you a tale, $r.$B$BLong ago a battle took place between gods. Agamaggan, our great boar god, fell to the earth after being defeated in the War of the Ancients, his blood raining down and his bones torn asunder. <snort>$B$BGreat thorns reached up out of the earth where his blood touched the ground, and his skull adorns one of the caverns to the south."] = "d52ac9f23097ac518acf35410500f4d6",
		["You have <snort> aided Mangletooth more than I would have dreamed, $r.$B$BThank you.$B$BAs long as I remain a captive here, you may bring me blood shards from the Bristleback quilboar and I will bless you with Agamaggan's power."] = "8aeb3b2baac2340138599df1745d85f1"
	},
	["Tatternack Steelforge"] = {
		["The Warchief has instructed me to study all kinds of weapons and armor. He has sent me here to the hub of both the tauren and orc cultures in the Barrens to meet as many travelers as possible, and to learn about the cultures of the Barrens.$B$BHe feels there's something to be learned from even the most pathetic of cultures... like the quilboar or centaur."] = "7d7cdc1000a3951e96ce7ea9aae1068e"
	},
	["Sputtervalve"] = {
		["See, the Venture Company's new shredder is better than my latest, from the interchangeable hands to the control grips!$b$bMy boss has given me a pretty strict deadline, but my boys and I couldn't come up with anything. Nothing was working, so we decided to 'borrow' one of their prototypes. I sent Wizzlecrank to the Sludge Fen to steal one, but he hasn't gotten back yet!"] = "2c903bf5264913f159eaf135732a79dc",
		["Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $n. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.$B$BNow, I must get back to work!"] = "b553c80d00cdd9070918c489df5ae9bc"
	},
	["Grub"] = {
		["Dig rats make some surprisingly tasty stew."] = "d8955ecbeacde25c934d7c426d254372"
	},
	["Tonga Runetotem"] = {
		["The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c. The ground itself quakes and cries out in anguish. We must remain resolute or we ourselves will be engulfed by the turmoil."] = "0189733449357bc7de4f96c49f05c00d"
	},
	["Baron Longshore"] = {
		["What're ye starin' at, $r? Come ta torment the condemned?"] = "de895887d8cdf92af2d7086fea1345d8",
		["<The Baron lifts his manacles.>$B$BCome on then, $c. Do ye trust me?"] = "067ba8a6a8742944123d598ff20dfceb",
		["Well? Don't ye have heads ta roll an' treasure ta dig up?"] = "24f2fe39759b737593c9e99546d2e44e"
	},
	["Traugh"] = {
		["The spirits have brought you to me, and so I feel blessed by them. "] = "226e4c5248a59d219e14d288106c8613"
	},
	["Jahan Hawkwing"] = {
		["The Barrens, with its hot sun and hostile denizens, is the perfect place to test your strength and fortitude."] = "18a3a77c5ae8b48a2bbaab1d5d833914"
	},
	["Kil'hala"] = {
		["Hey mon, what can I be doin' for you?"] = "b9c260f10777917d0aaa23c86b095d93"
	},
	["Zargh"] = {
		["Have a look at my meats, friend.  You won't want to go out into the Barrens without a good stock of provisions."] = "3cbc06359ec26be5a68c387070b4ffd6"
	},
	["Tinkerwiz"] = {
		["What? You want something?"] = "b0fb181dddc32fa304d6805b255e6bde"
	},
	["Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm"] = {
		["If you are here to waste my time, then you are wasting the time of the Cenarion Circle as a whole.  For your sake, let us hope that you are not foolish enough to be doing just that."] = "dbf255d67eb367a5e2e26df7615ab1d9",
		["Yes, but you'll find it more rewarding if you have skill in herbalism!  You will be required to nurture and cultivate special seeds -- not to swing an axe blindly or gesticulate wildly at passing shadows.  While the Evergreen Pouch you'll receive allows even the simplest brute to grow something, those who show some aptitude will have more bountiful results."] = "246b760cf38fc3d7b56b064fcda8d886"
	},
	["Thomas Miller"] = {
		["Just browsing my wares or is there something specific I can help you find today?"] = "a86de99ac7614f683ab7eab24b0a0b93",
		["Best deals in all of Stormwind my friend, won't find any better. Now, what can I help you with?"] = "0a50227fd4a79a221c5e74147031f06e"
	},
	["Bowen Brisboise"] = {
		["Pleased to make you acquaintance. May I help you?"] = "e291d9ad0a70ad2cbfd236c26b801d03"
	},
	["Claude Erksine"] = {
		["You've come for training in order to pass it on to your pets?"] = "1566d430b06beb690f54132cef76af32",
		["Ah friend, I only help hunters and their pets."] = "043d1db9fcbabde933fe81bd22b51be2",
		["Just like hunters, pets can choose specializations. Ferocious pets, like cats, can dish out damage but can't take it as well. Tenacious pets, like turtles, are more defensive and can occupy an enemy's attention while you stay at range. Cunning pets, like spiders, have a mix of offensive and defensive abilities and are particularly useful in Battlegrounds and Arenas.$b$bEach pet comes with a default specialization, but you can change it if you like."] = "dff8239a577f895e44801ce7aa51ae27",
		["You can't teach an old dog new tricks.  At least that's what someone once told me.  Lucky for you, I've discovered it to be untrue.$b$bNow then, would you like your pet to unlearn talents?"] = "b327ef379ff37c2b9e88427b9036a6db"
	},
	["Shelene Rhobart"] = {
		["Skin, glorious skin. It holds your insides... in. You might've noticed my skin's not doing so well. To think I used to worry about my pores. Hardly any skin left to worry about these days. In a way, it's very freeing."] = "21c1a4ade87cbd580ae80aa7f1f7ae8d"
	},
	["Guillaume Sorouy"] = {
		["Your interruption is costing me valuable time, this had better be good."] = "ba7308311ab1b7a9aa44fa79f5819089"
	},
	["Teldrassil Sentinel"] = {
		["If a bank is what you desire, then your travels take you to the heart of Darnassus.  There you will find storage for your treasures."] = "4ea5d9544049803bcffe33d330e2fb7d",
		["To reach the Rut'theran Ferry, you will need to travel to Darnassus and take the portal to Rut'theran Village at the base of Teldrassil."] = "f7f50698e64399e73c940b8e5999f55e",
		["Documents such as guild creation papers can be acquired from the Guild Master in the city of Darnassus.  "] = "073009f4d29320fba71c2b204da1fac8",
		["If you require time to rest and regain your strength, you will find the best at the Inn in Dolanaar.  Innkeeper Keldamyr will see to it that you are taken care of."] = "7044a367e4a4d0f456163951264eed1d",
		["You seek someone who cares for animals?  Then you should look for Seriadne outside the Inn in Dolanaar.  She is the one that you seek."] = "f973dc94f8e2f3e5bb9ad0a919636750",
		["The druid, Kal, often spends his time at the moonwell in Dolanaar.  I am certain he would be able to provide you with the training you require."] = "16bba8106fe5aa116151356d9d0c1668",
		["Dazalar is well known around Dolanaar for his hunting skill.  Why don't you talk to him and see what he can teach you?"] = "a50cc4748a430d5984fd12118582d8e4",
		["Laurna Morninglight offers healing to those that live around Dolanaar.  Perhaps she would be able to teach you in the ways of a priest."] = "4884b53e55dec4a3470d470b3fa83514",
		["You seek a rogue?  I believe Jannok would fit that description.  Why don't you go talk to him over at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "7ee91439488e010165881cb797efaa1e",
		["I had the pleasure of seeing Kyra Windblade in combat once.  Considering what I witnessed, I am confident she will train you well.  Look for her at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "c71b255b624a3a50ff4387076cd62716",
		["Cyndra's knowledge in alchemy is somewhat limited, but I'm sure it would be sufficient to get you started.  She practices her craft just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "2f7ad8bfc99055a560658a285e3618b3",
		["We could certainly use another cook around Dolanaar, not that Zarrin's cooking is lacking mind you.  Why don't you go see what he can teach you?"] = "0a5ce5d8a7759f29e79e96556ab20845",
		["Alanna spends most of her day at the Oracle Glade where she practices her profession.  Should you wish to learn the Enchanter's profession you will need to go there to find her."] = "15211b4d4b796d136e52a122b432560f",
		["Byancie's skill in First Aid has proven useful on numerous occasions.  You can find her just north of the Inn in Dolanaar if you wish to learn from her."] = "51ebad09e83f3656e4c78bc259beef52",
		["The Timberlings have made it too difficult for the fishermen to catch anything around Dolanaar.  You best look for someone to train you in Darnassus."] = "1806edb01b654109c85d847d2fc7129a",
		["Herbalism requires a gentle touch that few such as Malorne can teach.  Seek him out east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "80ed9b7cf270b2683ac103fb42181eba",
		["Nadyia has made quite the leatherworker in her years of practice.  Travel west on the road to Darnassus to pay her a visit and maybe she can bestow some of her knowledge upon you."] = "59c29a24054e9781525056418704352b",
		["Many of the supplies the tailors need come by way of Darnassus.  It is not surprising that they all moved there to work.  If you wish to be a tailor then you best head to Darnassus."] = "565828b0bf2c0a029bdd705634e05c4c",
		["There are many places that you might visit in Teldrassil.  Tell me what you seek."] = "274ed111b1b971c19cf221ceb6d4da6d",
		["The bank is located in the serene city of Darnassus.  You must go there if you wish to store your possessions."] = "6427b5ad172185229fdf52a2a91052ea",
		["Matters of such an official nature are only handled in Darnassus.  You must travel there to begin the process of your guild's creation."] = "d02f310024399482b9dac67cfc148f64",
		["A restful sleep is sure to be had in the beds which Innkeeper Keldamyr keeps at the Inn in Dolanaar.  "] = "94a6749341ef5f66c12f93180c75a230",
		["Ah, gentle Seriadne.  All animals are safe while in her care.  You can find her just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "4b9bee6beacd2d5faf637d1fc7af3558",
		["You will find numerous trainers around Dolanaar with ages of experience with which to tutor you.  Which would you have me point you to?"] = "3b62e4181d8e155be0d34c32038137f0",
		["The path of those who undertake a profession is long and rewarding.  Which path do you choose to walk?"] = "d23c8b801de15e2ee7f38ac7e99b1867",
		["You seek the aid of a Druid?  Then you should go see Kal at the Moonwell just south of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "7c41a2cdee58db931c3f57aaeecede92",
		["If a hunter is whom you seek, then it is Dazalar that you should visit.  He can usually be found just outside the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "6a033c0f5e434887661d585271c95874",
		["A priestess by the name of Laurna Morninglight calls Dolanaar home.  I believe she can be found just north of the Inn."] = "2c6cd31df344e81e13802e0526bd4f82",
		["A rogue?  I'm not in the habit of referring people to those types, but I believe Jannok would be the one you're looking for.  You will find him at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "83667d262f35fc73bb7553229dba8a25",
		["Kyra Windblade wields her blade with great skill.  She should be able to provide you with some training.  You'll find her at the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "2ff6748c5381da2b47cccf19dd9e9d98",
		["While Cyndra is not bubbly like her potions, her kind manner is suitable for teaching her trade.  You can find her just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "64eab3bd0b6e3e418b180b01fb4cd9a0",
		["Zarrin seems to have a good knowledge of the cooking trade.  Why don't you go see if he will show you some recipes?  He is usually cooking over by the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "83e47373c7b037c97ea19a841c67728b",
		["Alanna Raveneye attributes part of her talent in enchanting to her communion with the spirits at the Oracle Glade.  You should be able to find her there now."] = "9963e2c8079556e7e03308c3b714ad3d",
		["Byancie has often lent her services to the sentinels who patrol the local wilds.  You should talk to her if you desire to learn First Aid."] = "5236c19b097c185960d21473a0f76c58",
		["All the fisherman have moved to Darnassus with the recent attacks around Lake Al'Ameth.  You should try looking for someone to train you there."] = "f04c72b9d344f81d24b170747fc637e9",
		["Malorne somehow manages to pick the most delicate herbs without damaging them.  Certainly he is the one you should learn from.  He lives just east of the Inn in Dolanaar."] = "fa2f6a0bf9ea5e78c7cd9a9670147fcc",
		["Feyden Darkin is on the second floor in the center of the Craftsman's Terrace."] = "1ffe185b8d349e450492bcadda2d9b46",
		["The Maneweavers practice their professions out of their home on the road to Darnassus.  Nadyia is an excellent teacher when it comes to Leatherworking.  You should see what she can teach you."] = "f29cadd86be2633b030d2922ef0d73a4",
		["You can find Radnaal practicing his craft outside his home on the road to Darnassus.  You should stop by and see what he can teach you."] = "2e33db29fb989db5225ed21dd00dfc75",
		["I am certain there is a Tailor that could provide you training in Darnassus.  When you arrive, ask one of the Sentinels in Darnassus about seeing a Tailor."] = "fde658d3d3dda267bafe6d6134c02642"
	},
	["Alyissia"] = {
		["Greetings.  Do you seek instruction in art of war?"] = "d21f68288750cb295d23c5dd3f5d206b",
		["I do not see the warrior's spirit within you, child.  I have no teachings which would benefit a $c such as yourself."] = "aff660250ac92075478bdf7475083504",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "002e3e2a721f2f5fb8a4b9da6cdeb661",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "2e7772956c61eb73ece3cdf7879d839c"
	},
	["Frahun Shadewhisper"] = {
		["I don't train your kind $c."] = "f7c03ed04dab075fddaf94fa5e6690d8",
		["We are but darkness and shadows. Eternal. Invisible."] = "8bcc28a32ab2390c6dbf3ac05dc5341e",
		["Greetings young rogue. What do you seek?"] = "359b565e3f9598b0c4c99d31465a6002",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "30ee103c545f987ab518c70f6d3e640e",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "586819b65426f3f2408f1b727c1350a3"
	},
	["Shanda"] = {
		["Elune be with you, $c."] = "9f0b1ccaf183a8e36a2849671ae33e26",
		["My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?"] = "7f25bf796f093ccde831db9e50079867",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "002e3e2a721f2f5fb8a4b9da6cdeb661",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "2e7772956c61eb73ece3cdf7879d839c"
	},
	["Ayanna Everstride"] = {
		["Welcome to the Cenarion Circle, $c."] = "7b9df1f70b5451c09c6a5311f56bf07e",
		["I cannot train a $c such as yourself."] = "9bd1614bca66fd26e163696ba1b6b6fc",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "002e3e2a721f2f5fb8a4b9da6cdeb661",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "2e7772956c61eb73ece3cdf7879d839c"
	},
	["Mardant Strongoak"] = {
		["Even within cold, stone walls such as the ones that shelter this town, one may find tranquility and peace.  In fact, you may find them everywhere you are... simply look inside yourself for such balance."] = "922a94a8f826437fe0370bdcd6a587ac",
		["Welcome, my $g brother : sister;.  If you are here to train, then I would be delighted to train you.$B$BThere will be a time soon where the call of the Emerald Dream will take hold in you.  You will hibernate for many years and walk amongst the purest of forms.  It is there and then that your ultimate training will take place."] = "1d12fd8e421d229eea70c7677a2daeca",
		["Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?"] = "30ee103c545f987ab518c70f6d3e640e",
		["Dual Specialization allows you to keep two active Class Specialization, Talent, and Glyph sets and easily switch between them. You also will have separate glyph panes and action bars for each set. Switching between the two sets cannot be done while in combat and will consume your available resources."] = "586819b65426f3f2408f1b727c1350a3"
	},
